    { "type": "text", "id": "final_caption", "x": 20, "y": 430, "width": 900, "height": 66,
      "text": "denylist_entries answers \"is this entry blocked\" -- a pure point lookup, sharded by a hash of\nentry so a confirm() call always knows which shard to hit. ingestion_log answers \"what changed\nsince version N, in order\" -- the query replication actually runs, on a completely different shape.",
